# FUNNEL — TypeScript

## Imports

```typescript
// ✅ Graphics
import { Mesh, Vector3 } from 'three/webgpu';

// ✅ Physics
import RAPIER from '@dimforge/rapier3d-simd-compat';
import type { World, Collider } from '@dimforge/rapier3d-simd-compat';

// ❌ Avoid
import * as THREE from 'three'; // use three/webgpu
```

## Module template

```typescript
const LOCAL_TUNING = 0.5; // top-of-file config for this system only

export interface FooDeps { scene: Scene; world: World; }

export class Foo {
  constructor(private readonly deps: FooDeps) {}
}
```

## Domain folders

| Path | Responsibility |
|------|----------------|
| `src/app/` | Bootstrap, game loop wiring |
| `src/arena/` | Funnel shell, pillars, build system |
| `src/combat/` | Weapons, projectiles, hitscan |
| `src/input/` | Pointer lock, input snapshots |
| `src/physics/` | Rapier world, body sync |
| `src/player/` | Controller, camera, visuals, FBX |
| `src/render/` | WebGPU renderer & scene |
| `src/ui/` | HUD, toasts |
| `src/config/` | Cross-cutting constants only |

## Removal policy

Do not delete source files. Rename to `name-OLD-YYYYMMDDHHMM` and move under `/_deleted/`.
